flowchart LR
  P[Managed ESP32-S3 physical nodes] -->|contact / config sync / sparse HTTPS telemetry| I[FarmPi node + ingest API]
  S[16-node explicit simulator] -->|bearer-auth simulated telemetry| I
  I --> D[(MariaDB)]
  W[Diagnostic browser] --> A[FastAPI application API]
  N[Native Android: Ask, graphs, voice, settings, Nodes] -->|HTTPS farmpi.local| A
  A --> R[Deterministic router + semantic interpretation]
  R -->|farm fact/action| X[Approved resolver, analytics, confirmation]
  R -->|explanation / broad information| K[Grounding + source/provenance selection]
  X <--> D
  X --> PEV[Authoritative farm evidence]
  K --> SEV[Reviewed / model evidence]
  PEV --> C[Provenance-labelled context]
  SEV --> C
  C --> Q[Pi-local Qwen3 0.6B via llama.cpp]
  Q --> A
  X --> G[Verified charts + bounded evidence]
  G --> A
  A -->|answer / chart / evidence / status| N
  N -->|administrator node approval + desired config| A
